"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","review_id":"w6GlbUD3pdDqWqE_SLKFcQ","date":"2018-03-14T04:21:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9485713243484497,"text_excerpt":"Stanley's is located in the beautiful and bustling Jackson Square, perfect for grabbing a bite after walking the art displays and street shows. They have great service, and when the place is busy, there is a service bar window to order drinks while you're waiting for a table. We were seated right away on a Tuesday afternoon. Ordered mimosas, seafood gumbo (so freaking good), omelette sandwich (ham, cheese, bacon, omelette with green onions), and Breaux Bridge Eggs Benedict. The Benedict was perfect, my yolk flowed nicely and there a great balance of flavors--I devoured it. Nothing disappointed us. I wanted to try the bananas Foster (rum based syrup) and the red beans and rice, but I didn'..."},{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","review_id":"aZuJDtBvu3iWqr4_jF-AHw","date":"2015-02-12T20:50:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.946951150894165,"text_excerpt":"One of the best brunches I have ever had. I came here because I saw the photos for the eggs stella and wanted a giant deep fried soft shell crab on my eggs benedict. However, they discontinued this menu item because the crab is only seasonal and when it is off season, it is extremely expensive. I was extremely sad about this, but it is understandable. We first started out with some drinks. The bloody mary was everyone's favorite. It had a great spicy kick to it, and came with string beans and olives. I ordered the brandy milk shake, and it was delicious. It was a stronger drink, but it was flavorful. On to the amazing food... I got the breux bridge benedict. with boudin, ham, cheese, eggs..."},{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","review_id":"KA6HkMSR3OVHW54Hnhbutg","date":"2013-02-09T12:53:50","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9462776780128479,"text_excerpt":"Best pancakes in America? Maybe not, but definitely up there. I saw this on a list of best pancakes in the country, as well as on a couple other blogs. However, I also saw it mentioned as being a bit touristy, so I was on the fence about trying it out. I'm very glad I decided to, as it was an excellent meal to start the day. I think the touristy complaints about this place are owed simply to the fact that it is located in the heart of Jackson Square in the French Quarter. Other than that, and the fat families on vacation, there is nothing touristy about it and the food is really excellent. I wanted to try as much local food as possible during my short stay, so we started with the Voodoo B..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","photo_id":"NhqnfCyI2k-bXOW_9pWKKQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NhqnfCyI2k-bXOW_9pWKKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8574352264404297},{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","photo_id":"LwpK8WJ3tXf0SMgm8HLlRQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/LwpK8WJ3tXf0SMgm8HLlRQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8562586307525635},{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","photo_id":"Bd7_arAD-ojW_k5Aauub2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Bd7_arAD-ojW_k5Aauub2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.851649284362793},{"business_id":"EagkHaaC-kUozD3MPzbRIw","photo_id":"BLcM1wVTEdhnjFkJfXDAbw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/BLcM1wVTEdhnjFkJfXDAbw.jpg","v